    // The economy simulator's runs (spec 12.5, WP-M2-12): structural checks over the M2 placeholder tables, not tuning.
    // Every value is a PLACEHOLDER. The kill rate is QA wave 1's measured 20-minute exit run (1.33 kills per bot-minute,
